1
00:00:00,994 --> 00:00:03,994
(Toby:)A young boy on the cusp of manhood.

2
00:00:04,706 --> 00:00:09,546
(Toby:)His only companions,
mongrel dogs and malarial mosquitoes.

3
00:00:09,711 --> 00:00:13,051
(Toby:)Desperate and alone,
he reached out to a man...

4
00:00:13,215 --> 00:00:17,345
(Toby:)...who promised to introduce him
to a merciful, loving God...

5
00:00:17,511 --> 00:00:21,681
(Toby:)...but who instead introduced him
to a gin-pickled tongue...

6
00:00:21,848 --> 00:00:25,688
(Toby:)...shoved down his adolescent throat.

7
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:28,190
(Toby:)What choice did he have...

8
00:00:28,355 --> 00:00:34,195
(Toby:)...but to drink, shoot
and snort his pain away?

9
00:00:34,361 --> 00:00:36,821
Don't forget genetic predisposition
towards addiction.

10
00:00:36,988 --> 00:00:38,028
(Toby:)Never been proven.

11
00:00:38,198 --> 00:00:40,578
- There have been studies.
- Not double-blind studies.

12
00:00:40,742 --> 00:00:43,202
How could there be?
Who would be the control group?

13
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:45,450
(Leonard:)As you can see,
detoxing can get pretty ugly.

14
00:00:45,622 --> 00:00:47,702
(Leonard:)- Let's give them some privacy.
- Yeah.

15
00:00:47,874 --> 00:00:49,664
Do you wanna come over,
have coffee?

16
00:00:49,835 --> 00:00:52,875
- Sounds good.
- I have a video of me singing last night.

17
00:00:53,046 --> 00:00:54,876
Do you wanna see it?

18
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:57,680
- Gee, why wouldn't I?
- This is even better...

19
00:00:57,843 --> 00:01:01,023
(Penny:)...than you coming to the showcase,
now I get to watch you watch me.

